<title>JAPAN: Japan Development Bank eurobond rated AAA by S&amp;P.</title>
<headline>Japan Development Bank eurobond rated AAA by S&amp;P.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Tuesday that it had assigned its AAA rating to Japan Development Bank's $500 million 6.625 percent bonds due May 2, 2002.</p>
<p>Its rating outlook is stable, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
</text>
